{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/910954-giant-crossover-timeline","id":910954,"title":"giant crossover timeline","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-09T10:53:25-07:00","id":910954,"title":"giant crossover timeline","content":"I have written a crossover timeline combining classic World of Darkness, Chronicles of Darkness, Exalted, Scion and Trinity. It runs from 5 billion years ago (creation of the Triat) to 2123 (present day for the Aeon game). It is 26 pages long and constantly evolving, but I can summarize it in one paragraph.<br /> <br /> There are three timelines: classic World of Darkness, Chronicles of Darkness universe (split from the classic WoD timeline in 10,000 BC at the end of the Primordial War) and Trinity Continuum (split from the classic WoD timeline on N-Day in 1998). Exalted is the distant past of the WoD, and Scions are one of many supernaturals active in the modern-day WoD. There are also references to Street Fighter: the RPG, X-Files and Gossip Girl, just for flavor :-).<br /> <br /> Please let me know if you have any questions or constructive criticism. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T16:09:39-07:00","id":911221,"title":"","content":"Does your timeline invent explanations for contradictory accounts, or simply recite events as they are stated to have occurred in each universe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T18:32:48-07:00","id":911330,"title":"","content":"My timeline definitely invents explanations for contradictory accounts. It explains how all these different game settings can exist within the same universe. It's very detailed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T10:18:00-07:00","id":911742,"title":"","content":"Please tell me you homebrewed a cWoD-style <i>Gossip Girl</i> game. Please please please.<br /> <br /> (and if you haven't, I'm calling dibs--NO ONE TAKE MY IDEA!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-12T11:46:06-07:00","id":912894,"title":"","content":"